title: "Performance for PostgreSQL"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible PostgreSQL scaling experiments on AWS RDS (PostgreSQL 17.4) covering
  baseline performance, indexing, query optimization, connection pooling,
  table partitioning and read replicas, measured with pgbench.
